xbx-nrf licensing
=================

Copyright (c) 2026 zuidec

This project uses different licenses for different kinds of content. The full
license texts are in LICENSES/. Per-path details are in REUSE.toml
(https://reuse.software).

  Firmware and scripts (firmware/, build scripts, config)   MIT
  Hardware design (pcb/, references/pcb-cad.*)             CERN-OHL-S-2.0
  Documentation (docs/, *.md)                              CC-BY-4.0

Exceptions (third-party CAD parts; see ATTRIBUTION.md in each folder):

  pcb/xbx-nrf/lib/RKJXV122400R/,      SnapMagic CAD files, CC-BY-SA-4.0 with
  pcb/xbx-nrf-dongle/lib/USB_C_*/,    the SnapMagic Design Exception 1.0.
  pcb/xbx-nrf-dongle/lib/JS102011SAQN/

  pcb/xbx-nrf-dongle/lib/             Footprints copied from KiCad's
    xbx-nrf-lib.pretty/               libraries: CC-BY-SA-4.0 WITH
                                      KiCad-libraries-exception (the USB-C
                                      footprint there is SnapMagic's, above).

Not included: references/third-party/ (git-ignored) holds third-party documents
that are not part of this project and not covered by its licenses; see
references/README.md for their sources.
